  fhir:ValueSet.description [ fhir:value "Used as the answer options for the care considerations question in the Spirituality and Other Considerations Section, letting a patient flag considerations they want their care team to know before providing care."] ;
  fhir:ValueSet.copyright [ fhir:value "This material derives from the HL7 Terminology (THO). THO is copyright ©1989+ Health Level Seven International and is made available under the CC0 designation. For more licensing information see: https://terminology.hl7.org/license.html\n\nThis value set includes content developed through the DEMo Initiative and is subject to joint copyright of America's Health Insurance Plans (AHIP) and Health Level Seven International (HL7)."] ;
